COMMENT     Nucleotide sequence copied unchanged from the uploaded Word
            document. Backbone feature positions transferred by unique exact
            nucleotide matches to the supplied 4818-bp pGL3-Basic sequence;
            feature identities/coordinates based on the source plasmid figure
            and pGL3-Basic published annotations (Promega TM033; NovoPro
            V11544). Construct insert annotations from supplied sequence
            comparison. Restriction recognition motifs are exact sequence
            matches, not evidence of digestion. Circular topology assumed for
            plasmid constructs.
